{"type":"CSW_CAMPAIGN","campaignTitle":{"de":"CALLSIGN WOLF","en":"CALLSIGN WOLF","fr":"CALLSIGN WOLF","es":"CALLSIGN WOLF","pt":"CALLSIGN WOLF"},"campaignSublines":[{"de":"Fünf Einsätze. Eine Chance.","en":"Five missions. One chance.","fr":"Cinq missions. Une chance.","es":"Cinco misiones. Una oportunidad.","pt":"Cinco missões. Uma chance."}],"levels":[{"headline":{"de":"Erster Einsatz","en":"First Call","fr":"Premier engagement","es":"Primera misión","pt":"Primeira missão"},"sublines":[{"de":"Bergung · Tag · Windstill","en":"Rescue · Day · Calm","fr":"Sauvetage · Jour · Calme","es":"Rescate · Día · Calma","pt":"Resgate · Dia · Calmo"}],"briefing":{"de":"Ein Kleinflugzeug ist auf einer vorgelagerten Insel abgestürzt. Drei Überlebende — und die Black Box. Bedingungen sind gut, das Fenster klein. Handeln Sie jetzt.","en":"A light aircraft has gone down on an offshore island. Three survivors — and the black box. Conditions are clear, the window is closing. Move now.","fr":"Un avion léger s'est écrasé sur une île au large. Trois survivants — et la boîte noire. Les conditions sont claires, la fenêtre se réduit. Agissez maintenant.","es":"Un avión ligero se ha estrellado en una isla costera. Tres supervivientes — y la caja negra. Las condiciones son buenas, el margen se cierra. Actúe ahora.","pt":"Uma aeronave leve caiu em uma ilha offshore. Três sobreviventes — e a caixa preta. As condições são boas, a janela está fechando. Mova-se agora."},"gridSize":300,"terrain":"25,26x3,25,24,23,21,19,16,14,11,9,7,5,4,3x24,-10x261,27,28x3,27,26,24,22,20,17,15,12,9,7,5,4,3x25,-10x260,28,29x3,28,27,25,23,21,18,15,12,10,7,6,4,3x26,-10x259,29,30x3,29,28,26,24,21,18,15,12,10,8,5,4,3x28,-10x257,30,31x3,30,28,26,24,21,18,15,13,10,7,5,4,3x29,-10x256,30,31x3,30,29,26,24,21,18,15,12,9,7,5,4,3x30,-10x255,30,31x3,30,28,26,24,21,18,15,12,9,7,5,3x32,-10x254,30,31x2,30,29,28,26,23,20,18,14,11,9,6,4,3x33,-10x253,29,30x3,29,27,25,22,20,17,14,11,8,6,4,3x34,-10x252,29x4,28,26,24,22,19,16,13,10,7,5,4,3